      "text": "Galatians reads Abraham's faith and the blessing of the nations as scriptural grounds for gentile reception of the Spirit and inclusion in the promised family. Genesis 15:6 is quoted within a new gentile-inclusion argument; Jewish readings of Abraham are not invalidated merely because Paul's reading is canonical for Christians.",
